# .gitignore — KiCad board artifact
#
# Kept inside the artifact folder so it stays self-contained: this folder
# could be extracted into a standalone repository and keep its rules.
#
# Committed here: design sources, and outputs/ holding the fab-agnostic
# exports of the last freeze (schematic PDF, BOM, position, gerbers, drill,
# STEP). `main` only ever carries manufactured and validated revisions, so
# those exports are in sync with the sources by construction.

# ── Fab-branded outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vendor plugin folders and their databases. Generic gerbers belong in
# outputs/, never under a vendor name.
jlcpcb/
*.db

# ── KiCad — volatile / local files ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-machine display settings (layer visibility, zoom...)
*.kicad_prl
# Open-project lock markers
*.lck
~*.lck
# Automatic backups
*-backups/
_autosave-*
\#auto_saved_files\#
*.kicad_sch-bak
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.sch-bak
*.bak
*.bck
*.000
*.tmp
*~
*-save.pro
*-save.kicad_pcb
# Symbol/footprint caches
# (fp-lib-table and sym-lib-table ARE committed: project configuration)
fp-info-cache
*-cache.lib
*-rescue.lib
*-rescue.kicad_sym
# Intermediate exports, regenerated on demand
*.net
*.dsn
*.ses
